{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls6_jpg\\geo\\081.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "5.7Ways toImproveQualityof Environment", "conf": 0.903, "box": [[75, 131], [826, 142], [825, 181], [74, 171]]}, {"text": "Our environment is continuously changing. Human activities and natural disasters have brought", "conf": 0.923, "box": [[69, 201], [1197, 208], [1197, 248], [68, 241]]}, {"text": "drastic changes in environment. For example mining, deforestation and industrialization are", "conf": 0.936, "box": [[69, 239], [1199, 244], [1199, 284], [68, 279]]}, {"text": "theenvironment.", "conf": 0.895, "box": [[73, 316], [293, 323], [293, 350], [72, 343]]}, {"text": ". We need to plant more trees to improve quality of our environment.", "conf": 0.941, "box": [[69, 358], [881, 363], [881, 403], [68, 398]]}, {"text": ".Pakistan has a lower forest cover in the world.", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[71, 405], [636, 413], [636, 446], [70, 438]]}, {"text": ".We should use alternative resources of energy like solar, wind and hydroelectric sources.", "conf": 0.928, "box": [[68, 447], [1120, 451], [1120, 494], [68, 490]]}, {"text": "3Rs is the order of action to be taken to reduce the amount of waste generated and conservation", "conf": 0.947, "box": [[70, 496], [1205, 500], [1205, 536], [70, 532]]}, {"text": "ofnaturalresources.", "conf": 0.907, "box": [[73, 534], [331, 541], [330, 567], [72, 560]]}, {"text": "Save the", "conf": 0.731, "box": [[150, 643], [331, 646], [330, 684], [149, 681]]}, {"text": "Recycle", "conf": 0.795, "box": [[728, 645], [883, 645], [883, 689], [728, 689]]}, {"text": "Conserve", "conf": 0.867, "box": [[449, 646], [636, 652], [635, 689], [448, 682]]}, {"text": "Save", "conf": 0.78, "box": [[1019, 643], [1120, 646], [1119, 685], [1018, 681]]}, {"text": "Earth", "conf": 0.777, "box": [[182, 691], [299, 691], [299, 729], [182, 729]]}, {"text": "Water", "conf": 0.686, "box": [[483, 691], [604, 697], [602, 735], [481, 729]]}, {"text": "Paper", "conf": 0.824, "box": [[745, 693], [867, 698